{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12243020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12243020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1224302001:1":{"text":"여기 있을 줄 알았어.","source_cn":"就知道你在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x975E6C61A1E78610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224302002:1":{"text":"이야, 무슨 바람이 널 여기로 데리고 온 거야? 희한하네.","source_cn":"嘿，哪阵风把你吹来的？真稀奇啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FEDEA403EA7E7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224302003:1":{"text":"잠깐, 옷 갈아입은 거야? 드디어 그 선장 옷을 벗었네?","source_cn":"等等，你换衣服了？终于舍得脱下那身船长服了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EC9F52673F8030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224302004:1":{"text":"항구에서 그런 옷차림을 하고 다니면 너무 눈에 띄어서 불편하더라고.","source_cn":"穿那身在港口太引人注意了，不自在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72A42B477D82990F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224302005:1":{"text":"쓸데없는 소리는 그만하고. 스몰워터 마을 사람들에게 배 수리를 부탁하려고 왔어.","source_cn":"废话少说。我要请小水村的人帮忙修船。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24CB2ED329F4EA79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224302006:1":{"text":"아! 어쩐지 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 데려왔더라니. <male>이 친구</male><female>이 친구</female>에게 날 설득해달라고 하려던 거였구나.","source_cn":"哦！难怪你们找来了<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A44051D9A79C4DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아! 어쩐지 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 데려왔더라니. <male>이 친구</male><female>이 친구</female>에게 날 설득해달라고 하려던 거였구나.","female":"아! 어쩐지 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 데려왔더라니. <male>이 친구</male><female>이 친구</female>에게 날 설득해달라고 하려던 거였구나.","variant_male_record_index":"139329","variant_female_record_index":"139330","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1224302006":{"text":"아! 어쩐지 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 데려왔더라니. <male>이 친구</male><female>이 친구</female>에게 날 설득해달라고 하려던 거였구나.","source_cn":"哦！难怪你们找来了<style=stress><player_name></style>，原来是请<male>他</male><female>她</female>当说客。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A44051D9A79C4DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아! 어쩐지 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 데려왔더라니. <male>이 친구</male><female>이 친구</female>에게 날 설득해달라고 하려던 거였구나.","female":"아! 어쩐지 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(을)를 데려왔더라니. <male>이 친구</male><female>이 친구</female>에게 날 설득해달라고 하려던 거였구나.","variant_male_record_index":"139329","variant_female_record_index":"139330","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224302007:1":{"text":"그냥 거기에 서 있기만 해도 돼.","source_cn":"你不用说，站在那儿就足够了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9B3B498BEA6E3606","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그냥 거기에 서 있기만 해도 돼.","female":"그냥 거기에 서 있기만 해도 돼.","variant_male_record_index":"139331","variant_female_record_index":"139332","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224302010:1":{"text":"지금은 잡담이나 할 때가 아니야! 신밧드, 나랑 같이 스몰워터 마을로 돌아가자.","source_cn":"现在不是闲聊的时候！辛巴达，跟我一起回小水村。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D3C2EB6F25916EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224302011:1":{"text":"정보상으로서 내 시간은 돈이야. 왜, 돈 내고 고용하기라도 하게?","source_cn":"作为一个情报贩子，我的时间是可以卖钱的。怎么，你要付钱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x382B1797B804B4F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224302012:1":{"text":"입만 살아서는.","source_cn":"油嘴滑舌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A57987FF7727D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224302013:1":{"text":"두 번 말하게 하지 말고 나.랑.돌.아.가.자.고.","source_cn":"不要再让我说一遍，跟，我，回，去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x543633978E0F48C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224302014:1":{"text":"몇 번을 말해도 똑같아. 난 오늘 물고기 열 마리를 잡아야 돌아갈 거니까. 지금까지 여섯 마리를 잡았으니 <style=\"highlight\">네 마리 남았어</style>. 아직 멀었다고!","source_cn":"说多少遍都一样。我今天得钓够十条鱼回去，现在才只有六条...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DEC12688E6DA786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224302015:1":{"text":"아니면, 너도 나랑 같이할래?","source_cn":"要不，你和我一起钓？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7390FAE2C59F220C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224302016:0":{"text":"...흥. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이 낚시 고수니까 <male>그냥</male><female>그냥</female> 도와달라고 해.","source_cn":"……哼。<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x64C3AF56686FEBA7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...흥. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이 낚시 고수니까 <male>그냥</male><female>그냥</female> 도와달라고 해.","female":"...흥. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이 낚시 고수니까 <male>그냥</male><female>그냥</female> 도와달라고 해.","variant_male_record_index":"139343","variant_female_record_index":"139344","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1224302017:1":{"text":"잠깐, 왜 무슨 일이든 다 마스터에게 도와달라고 하시는 거죠! 마스터는 블러디 로즈의 귀한 손님인데요!","source_cn":"等等，怎么什么事都要主人来帮忙啊！主人明明是血薇帮的贵宾！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6A7EF8CC02A2C5A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잠깐, 왜 무슨 일이든 다 마스터에게 도와달라고 하시는 거죠! 마스터는 블러디 로즈의 귀한 손님인데요!","female":"잠깐, 왜 무슨 일이든 다 마스터에게 도와달라고 하시는 거죠! 마스터는 블러디 로즈의 귀한 손님인데요!","variant_male_record_index":"139345","variant_female_record_index":"139346","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1224302018:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 신밧드의 낚시를 좀 도와주세요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x874D86204943CF62","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"st